o\" id=\"style-css-av-78ddib-a60b2a1d25b56d78ab936926d9ccf282\">\n#top .hr.av-78ddib-a60b2a1d25b56d78ab936926d9ccf282{\nmargin-top:0;\nmargin-bottom:10px;\n}\n.hr.av-78ddib-a60b2a1d25b56d78ab936926d9ccf282 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-78ddib-a60b2a1d25b56d78ab936926d9ccf282 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-1  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_one_half  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div class='flex_column_table av-5ceqsz-c3fb0850796a309ed3cc693a6fa328de sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable'><div  class='flex_column av-5ceqsz-c3fb0850796a309ed3cc693a6fa328de av_one_half  avia-builder-el-2  el_after_av_hr  el_before_av_one_half  first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-m0ndh2zw-e4167a071898e543a580ad593f2ff7fc '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/BlogPosting\" itemprop=\"blogPost\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p data-start=\"2694\" data-end=\"2927\">La soci\u00e9t\u00e9 VENOL MOTOR OIL informe de cas de contrefa\u00e7on de produits de la marque VENOL ainsi que de distribution non autoris\u00e9e li\u00e9e \u00e0 <strong data-start=\"2851\" data-end=\"2911\">Samer Al Gaddah International General Trading Co. L.L.C.<\/strong>, bas\u00e9e \u00e0 Duba\u00ef.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"3084\">Cette entit\u00e9 <strong data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"3016\">n\u2019est pas un partenaire ni un distributeur autoris\u00e9 des produits VENOL<\/strong> et pourrait tenter de commercialiser des produits non authentiques.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3086\" data-end=\"3212\">Les seules soci\u00e9t\u00e9s autoris\u00e9es \u00e0 utiliser la marque VENOL sont :<br data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3153\" \/>VENOL MOTOR OIL Sp. z o.o. et VENOL MOTOR OIL GmbH.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3214\" data-end=\"3321\">Les clients et distributeurs sont invit\u00e9s \u00e0 faire preuve de vigilance et \u00e0 v\u00e9rifier l\u2019origine des produits.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3323\" data-end=\"3413\">Veuillez trouver ci-joint la d\u00e9claration officielle de VENOL concernant cette affaire.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div>\n<div class='av-flex-placeholder'><\/div><div  class='flex_column av-4pwcf7-6cec4ad7a8e8572bb6b19a073b81d82c av_one_half  avia-builder-el-4  el_after_av_one_half  el_before_av_button  flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-m0ndjbav-4cda72d3c14178ac7a932e8b9e3f04a3\">\n.avia-image-container.av-m0ndjbav-4cda72d3c14178ac7a932e8b9e3f04a3 img.avia_image{\nbox-shadow:none;\n}\n.avia-image-container.av-m0ndjbav-4cda72d3c14178ac7a932e8b9e3f04a3 .av-image-caption-overlay-center{\ncolor:#ffffff;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='avia-image-container av-m0ndjbav-4cda72d3c14178ac7a932e8b9e3f04a3 av-styling- avia-align-center  avia-builder-el-5  avia-builder-el-no-sibling '   itemprop=\"image\" itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/ImageObject\" ><div class=\"avia-image-container-inner\"><div class=\"avia-image-overlay-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" class='wp-image-4970 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-4970 avia_image ' src=\"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/warning-news.png\" alt='' title='warning-news'  height=\"661\" width=\"1024\"  itemprop=\"thumbnailUrl\" srcset=\"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/warning-news.png 1024w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/warning-news-300x194.png 300w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/warning-news-768x496.png 768w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/warning-news-705x455.png 705w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 -->\n<div  class='avia-button-wr